title Order status changing Sequence Diagram

top to bottom direction

@startuml Order status changing
actor Operator
participant "MES Frontend" as Frontend
participant "MES API" as API
participant "MES Database" as DB
participant "Cache (Redis)" as Cache
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ

Operator -> Frontend: Изменение статуса заказа #123
activate Frontend

Frontend -> API: PATCH /orders/123 {status}
activate API

API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status=...
activate DB
DB --> API: Успешное обновление
deactivate DB

API -> Cache: del order:123
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

API -> Cache: del orders:page:*
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

API -> MQ: publish OrderUpdated(orderId=123)
activate MQ
MQ --> API: ACK
deactivate MQ

API --> Frontend: 200 OK
deactivate API

Frontend --> Operator: Статус обновлен
deactivate Frontend

... Системные события ...

MQ -> Cache: Инвалидация кеша
activate Cache
Cache -> Cache: Удаление всех ключей с order:123*
Cache -> Cache: Удаление всех ключей с orders:list:*
deactivate Cache
@enduml